eck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "78910218", "author": {"steamid": "76561198124939232", "personaname": "cowking112", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198124939232/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 20795, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9961, "last_played": 1760233016, "avatar": "ba6615bab61be9613ebe195c1b71b4b5c07fe9c5"}, "language": "english", "review": "I can't recommend this game enough, it is just so much fun, both alone and especially with friends. There's nothing quite like getting an item that makes meteors rain down from the sky and listening to your friends panicking about it.\n\nThe process of unlocking items and characters is also really enjoyable. There's no paywalls or grinding, you just play the game. Sure, you may be frustrated when you can't manage to get that one item to unlock the collectible log for it (looking at you irradiant pearl), but there's no fun in getting everything handed to you is there?\n\nIn short, just buy the game already. The devs deserve it and so do you.", "timestamp_created": 1604791106, "timestamp_updated": 1604791106, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "78909986", "author": {"steamid": "76561198808027258", "personaname": "Vellichoir", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198808027258/", "num_games_owned": 102, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 21412, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6875, "last_played": 1787210682, "avatar": "4e2010f5c0bc4b5567e3c017439d35069be0d86f"}, "language": "english", "review": "its really pretty and has a